WEBVTT

00:00:00.190 --> 00:00:08.080
it does we'll return to our story in just one minute rangers rangers did you ever think what

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:13.300
it would be like traveling along in an open car without a windshield boy you wouldn't go very far

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:18.530
before you got all splattered with mud and you'd have to keep your eyes closed so as not to be

00:00:18.530 --> 00:00:24.400
blinded by the dust well when you're traveling along in life rangers common sense acts as a

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:29.500
pretty important windshield. It lets you see where you're going. And at the same time,

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.540
keeps you from getting splattered by the mud of prejudice.

00:00:33.970 --> 00:00:35.930
Now, suppose you've made pals with some fella.

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:38.830
Maybe he goes to a church that's different from yours,

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:41.120
or his folks come from a different country,

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:43.360
or his skin is of a different color.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:45.900
Will these differences get in your way?

00:00:46.620 --> 00:00:47.240
Of course not.

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:49.220
Heck, you know what he's like inside.

00:00:49.780 --> 00:00:51.400
You know he's fun to be with,

00:00:51.480 --> 00:00:54.120
he likes the same games and goes to the same hobbies,

00:00:54.460 --> 00:00:56.560
and sticks up for you like a real pal.

00:00:57.380 --> 00:00:59.980
Well, that's how your common sense acts as a windshield.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:06.740
shield rangers as long as you use it no one can throw dust in your eyes now let's get back to our

00:01:06.740 --> 00:01:07.060
story
